                                                "sense_id": "cf6424a4-e292-3d69-a317-465be07f7f58",
                                                "text": "“We’ve lived it. We’ll never give up our collection. Ever. And maybe, one day, you’ll be the one to come and barter a loaf of bread for our DVD of Casino.”"
