                                                "sense_id": "d22260dd-a693-3dfc-926e-1c33a34b7730",
                                                "text": "However, if postoperative anatomic intorsion is present, the patient may have DVD that was incorrectly diagnosed as IOOA and treated by IO muscle recessions."
